WEBVTT

00:03.480 --> 00:05.750
<i>I hated myself for so long.</i>

00:06.880 --> 00:10.970
<i>I was ugly and sour 
and not charming at all.</i>

00:11.740 --> 00:16.130
<i>"Love brings only terror." 
That's what I thought, until...</i>

00:17.580 --> 00:18.710
Akaishi-san.

00:23.280 --> 00:24.970
I really like you.

00:24.970 --> 00:27.850
Will you go out with me?

00:39.910 --> 00:44.090
<i>A massive creature has appeared! 
A massive creature has appeared!</i>

00:44.090 --> 00:47.440
<i>Anyone in the vicinity of the Sumida 
River, please evacuate at once!</i>

00:47.440 --> 00:49.860
<i>This is an emergency. 
This is an emergency!</i>

00:49.860 --> 00:52.820
We meet again!

00:52.820 --> 00:55.790
Kuro-tan, not again!

