<b>A Gyaru and Lipstick</b>

02:34.310 --> 02:37.600
What's going on with you, Kuro-tan?

02:37.600 --> 02:40.540
You've been turning into a kaiju 
all the time lately!

02:40.540 --> 02:42.470
Ever since that metal festival!

02:44.960 --> 02:47.900
Will you be all right to start 
your new school term like this?

02:51.730 --> 02:54.070
Dry off before you leave the bathroom!

02:56.740 --> 02:59.700
Arata Minami

02:56.740 --> 02:59.700
m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215

02:56.740 --> 02:59.700
I'll be waiting
 in the park.

02:56.740 --> 02:59.700
m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215

02:56.740 --> 02:59.700
By the big sphere!

03:01.800 --> 03:03.510
Be back later!

03:09.040 --> 03:11.300
<i>I haven't seen him in person 
since the festival!</i>

03:11.750 --> 03:14.600
<i>And now I'll get to see him every day!</i>

03:21.130 --> 03:22.260
Akaishi-san!

03:23.760 --> 03:27.750
<i>He's shining even brighter than before!</i>

03:30.670 --> 03:33.550
Good morning. 
It's awfully bright today, isn't it?

03:36.840 --> 03:38.950
Maybe I've been playing 
too many smartphone games.

03:38.950 --> 03:40.540
Yeah, too many.

03:40.540 --> 03:41.440
Right?

03:46.470 --> 03:48.450
I wish we didn't have to shuffle classes.

03:49.960 --> 03:54.800
Oh, but even if we end up in different 
classes, it shouldn't change much.

03:55.190 --> 03:56.900
Since we're...

03:59.310 --> 04:00.850
dating, after all.

04:09.770 --> 04:10.980
Arata!

04:12.000 --> 04:13.490
What brings you here?

04:13.490 --> 04:16.070
Oh, meeting up with my girlfriend.

04:17.060 --> 04:17.780
Huh?

04:17.780 --> 04:21.190
Don't lose it before 
the term's even started, man!

04:21.190 --> 04:22.760
Introduce me to her later.

04:22.760 --> 04:23.990
Sure.

04:25.030 --> 04:27.120
<i>That was a close call.</i>

04:27.710 --> 04:30.390
<i>But did he call me his girlfriend?</i>

04:30.390 --> 04:31.970
<i>Introduce me?!</i>

04:31.970 --> 04:33.960
<i>I totally forgot in all the hype.</i>

04:33.960 --> 04:37.090
<i>If people realize 
I'm Minami-kun's girlfriend...</i>

04:37.390 --> 04:40.930
No way, Arata! Why Psycho-tan?!

04:40.930 --> 04:42.870
I'm never liking your posts ever again!

04:42.870 --> 04:45.970
<i>He'll be a laughingstock, 
and it'll be my fault!</i>

04:48.490 --> 04:49.640
Hey, there you are!

04:53.470 --> 04:55.570
You're fast, Akaishi-san!

04:55.570 --> 04:58.450
D-Don't walk beside me!

04:59.050 --> 04:59.650
Why?

04:59.650 --> 05:02.110
At school, we should pretend 
we don't know each other!

05:03.240 --> 05:06.700
If you hang out with me, people will 
think something's wrong with you!

05:06.700 --> 05:10.340
You lose friends and likes!

05:14.270 --> 05:16.380
I don't want any likes.

05:16.380 --> 05:18.340
And I don't want friends that shallow.

05:18.870 --> 05:20.800
I can't pretend I don't know you.

05:21.290 --> 05:22.800
You're my girlfriend.

05:26.670 --> 05:27.660
Uh-oh!

05:27.970 --> 05:29.440
Hey, wait!

05:30.910 --> 05:32.080
Akaishi-san, I'm so—

05:32.080 --> 05:32.880
Sorry.

05:32.880 --> 05:36.550
We don't have to pretend 
we don't know each other.

05:36.550 --> 05:39.400
But can we pretend 
we're just friends instead?

05:42.310 --> 05:43.350
Okay.

05:45.250 --> 05:47.200
I'm sorry to be so selfish.

05:47.770 --> 05:52.220
I wish you'd be more selfish, personally.

05:53.600 --> 05:56.200
Well, I'll walk ahead, then.

06:03.770 --> 06:05.570
<i>Be more selfish?</i>

06:06.080 --> 06:07.470
<i>Do I deserve to do that?</i>

06:09.860 --> 06:11.780
<i>I wish I had more confidence.</i>

06:12.520 --> 06:13.640
Excuse me!

06:15.180 --> 06:17.900
You attend Ginjuji High School, don't you?

06:18.220 --> 06:19.240
Yes...

06:19.240 --> 06:22.730
Could you give this to my brother?

06:22.730 --> 06:23.530
He's a first-year...

06:23.790 --> 06:27.160
No, a second-year now. 
His name is Arata Minami.

06:28.290 --> 06:29.440
I know him!

06:29.440 --> 06:30.850
Really?!

06:30.850 --> 06:32.450
He really <i>is</i> popular!

06:32.450 --> 06:35.870
I told him to grab his lunch 
and he said he had it!

06:35.870 --> 06:38.670
Now that he's got his new girlfriend, 
he can't keep a thought in his head!

06:38.670 --> 06:41.630
There was that whole 
kaiju rampage yesterday,

06:41.630 --> 06:44.590
but he didn't even notice 
the emergency alarms!

06:44.590 --> 06:48.180
He was all, "Ooh, I was just 
thinking about Akaishi-san!"

06:48.180 --> 06:51.310
I suppose this Akaishi-san person 
must be <i>very</i> pretty.

06:52.710 --> 06:53.700
Whoops!

06:53.700 --> 06:55.560
Well, take it to him, then!

07:04.140 --> 07:06.410
Minami-kun and Psycho-tan?

07:06.680 --> 07:08.660
That can't really be true.

07:08.660 --> 07:09.620
There he is!

07:10.360 --> 07:11.330
Huh?

07:11.330 --> 07:13.460
He's by himself.

07:13.460 --> 07:16.040
Guess they had it wrong, then.

07:16.040 --> 07:18.300
He'd never go for Psycho-tan!

07:18.300 --> 07:20.500
Don't scare me like that!

07:24.470 --> 07:28.270
Your little sister... wanted me 
to bring you your lunch.

07:28.270 --> 07:33.470
And... y-you shouldn't 
ignore emergency alarms.

07:33.470 --> 07:37.440
Um... you know. I think...

07:39.400 --> 07:42.610
the kaiju will probably 
appear again tonight!

07:44.190 --> 07:45.070
Sure.

07:45.780 --> 07:47.070
I'll be careful.

07:49.030 --> 07:49.740
<b>Class B</b>

07:49.870 --> 07:50.530
<b>Arata Minami</b>

07:50.530 --> 07:51.280
<b>Class C</b>

07:51.280 --> 07:51.990
<b>Kuroe Akaishi</b>

07:51.990 --> 07:53.920
We're separated, huh?

07:55.200 --> 07:58.640
We might be in different classes, 
but we can still have lunch together.

07:58.640 --> 07:59.760
R-Right!

08:01.380 --> 08:02.840
See you later!

08:02.840 --> 08:04.800
S-Sure.

08:05.100 --> 08:08.760
Congratulations on your 
successful coupling, Kuroe-san!

08:08.760 --> 08:11.920
I'm as happy as if my own love 
had borne fruit!

08:11.920 --> 08:13.370
Thanks.

08:13.970 --> 08:17.560
This demands a celebration! 
Call Harugon at once!

08:19.600 --> 08:22.690
I was really hoping for 
a chill start to the new term.

08:22.690 --> 08:24.780
This is a really bad sign.

08:25.180 --> 08:28.380
I don't want a new class...

08:28.380 --> 08:31.320
I'm more than happy 
to be with you, Kuroe-san!

08:31.320 --> 08:34.400
What if some nasty gyaru targets me?

08:34.400 --> 08:37.910
Then I'll protect you 
in Minami-kun's place!

08:38.430 --> 08:39.930
Manatsu-san?

08:41.750 --> 08:43.090
<i>Then I can do this!</i>

08:44.760 --> 08:47.500
You're something else, y'know.

08:47.500 --> 08:50.500
How'd <i>you</i> get in with Minami-kun?

08:50.500 --> 08:51.800
Gotta give it up.

08:51.800 --> 08:53.760
<i>I'm deep in the jungle!</i>

08:53.760 --> 08:54.760
Manatsu-san!

08:54.760 --> 08:57.170
Tomosato-san, wanna see 
this with me sometime?

08:57.170 --> 08:59.940
I'm afraid I can't follow movies 
with only human characters.

08:59.940 --> 09:02.120
Tomosato-san, can I have 
your contact info?

09:00.380 --> 09:02.620
<i>She's too popular! I can't see her!</i>

09:02.120 --> 09:03.540
You may not!

09:02.620 --> 09:04.890
You listening to me?

09:04.890 --> 09:06.280
Morning, all!

09:08.000 --> 09:11.340
Hey, lots of people from my last class!

09:11.340 --> 09:13.120
What a great vibe!

09:13.120 --> 09:15.410
Rairi! You look so pretty again!

09:15.410 --> 09:17.190
The orange tones look amazing on you!

09:17.190 --> 09:18.250
Right?!

09:18.250 --> 09:20.160
I saw your cosmetics report yesterday!

09:20.160 --> 09:21.230
Sweet!

09:21.230 --> 09:22.500
<i>Wh-What the...</i>

09:22.810 --> 09:27.210
<i>Her eyes are so wide. Her skin is 
so lustrous. The highest caste there is...</i>

09:27.210 --> 09:29.720
<i>If she targets me, I'm doomed.</i>

09:30.090 --> 09:32.220
Rairi, did you hear? That girl over there.

09:32.220 --> 09:33.140
<i>Argh!</i>

09:33.140 --> 09:35.710
They're saying she's 
Minami-kun's girlfriend.

09:42.770 --> 09:44.380
<i>I-It begins!</i>

09:51.300 --> 09:53.030
<i>Violence?!</i>

09:56.550 --> 09:58.370
You gotta straighten out that posture.

10:00.580 --> 10:03.460
Hunching over all the time 
is really unattractive!

10:03.460 --> 10:04.540
Chest out, chin up!

10:05.900 --> 10:08.420
And look at those lips! 
They're all chapped up!

10:08.420 --> 10:10.760
What a waste of great material!

10:10.760 --> 10:11.630
C'mere!

10:13.950 --> 10:16.020
What color should we go with?

10:16.020 --> 10:17.670
Um, Rairi?

10:17.670 --> 10:19.220
Yeah, let's go with this.

10:20.250 --> 10:23.740
We'll use a lip balm scrub 
to even them out...

10:21.180 --> 10:23.560
Lip Balm Scrub

10:21.180 --> 10:23.560
Lip Balm Scrub

10:24.130 --> 10:26.440
Then add some lip concealer...

10:25.190 --> 10:26.440
Lip Concealer

10:25.190 --> 10:26.440
Lip Concealer

10:26.440 --> 10:30.030
Then we apply the lipstick 
just to the center...

10:28.070 --> 10:30.030
Lipstick

10:28.070 --> 10:30.030
Lipstick

10:30.030 --> 10:32.900
Then we blot it outwards with a finger.

10:32.900 --> 10:35.910
Lip Gloss

10:32.900 --> 10:35.910
Lip Gloss

10:32.900 --> 10:36.100
Then the faintest hint 
of gloss to top it off...

10:36.690 --> 10:38.320
All done!

10:39.960 --> 10:41.860
Isn't she the cutest?!

10:41.860 --> 10:45.540
Y-Yeah, it really brings out her color...

10:45.540 --> 10:47.670
What a transformation!

10:48.230 --> 10:49.750
Posi-peace!

10:50.130 --> 10:51.960
<i>P-Posi...?</i>

10:51.960 --> 10:55.180
I'm Kohno Raimu! Call me Rairi, 'kay!

10:55.180 --> 10:56.850
Rairi, do me, too!

10:56.850 --> 10:58.720
Can we get a makeup tutorial?!

10:58.720 --> 11:00.430
I'm on it!

11:01.590 --> 11:04.080
<i>Painting my lips 
won't make any difference.</i>

11:04.080 --> 11:05.640
<i>I'm still a kaiju.</i>

11:06.970 --> 11:09.040
<i>But I feel... kinda...</i>

11:10.190 --> 11:11.570
Next up.

11:11.930 --> 11:13.570
<i>Just a little...</i>

11:13.980 --> 11:16.420
I-I'm Akaishi Kuroe.

11:16.420 --> 11:18.750
Feel free to talk to me anytime.

11:18.750 --> 11:20.530
I look forward to studying with you!

11:20.530 --> 11:23.100
Nice to meet you.

11:23.100 --> 11:25.000
Good. Next up.

11:29.550 --> 11:33.120
<i>She seems... kinda nice.</i>

11:35.590 --> 11:37.550
YSM's new lipstick is so vibrant

11:40.970 --> 11:43.140
Wh-What is it?

11:43.140 --> 11:45.900
You seem kinda different 
from this morning.

11:45.900 --> 11:48.650
Oh, I thought so, too!

11:48.650 --> 11:50.690
Is it because she's wearing lipstick?

11:51.110 --> 11:53.650
It's like your face is in full flower!

11:53.650 --> 11:57.700
Like the first stage of 
a bio-kaiju's evolution!

11:57.700 --> 11:59.850
K-Kaiju?!

12:01.240 --> 12:03.020
I-I'm taking it off.

12:03.020 --> 12:04.620
But it looks wonderful!

12:04.930 --> 12:07.580
It looks great on you! You're beautiful!

12:13.170 --> 12:15.460
Th-Thank you.

12:15.780 --> 12:18.230
Love makes a girl beautiful, as they say.

12:18.230 --> 12:21.050
N-No, a girl from my class did it...

12:25.520 --> 12:28.180
<i>I guess it wiped off while I was eating.</i>

12:28.180 --> 12:32.800
<i>It was such a nice color. 
I wonder where she bought it...</i>

12:33.190 --> 12:35.150
<i>I wanna ask...</i>

12:38.510 --> 12:40.200
<i>No, better not.</i>

12:42.550 --> 12:45.370
It looks great on you! You're beautiful!

12:48.560 --> 12:50.050
I totally feel that!

12:50.050 --> 12:52.560
U-Um, Rairi-san?

12:53.000 --> 12:55.960
Where did you buy that lipstick you used?!

12:58.300 --> 13:01.130
<i>She's grossed out. Of course she is.</i>

13:01.530 --> 13:04.370
<i>What's the point of dressing up 
a dud like me?</i>

13:04.370 --> 13:05.850
Oh, that?

13:05.850 --> 13:07.520
Wanna come buy some with me?

13:11.610 --> 13:14.850
<i>Are you kidding me? Never thought 
I'd go shopping with a gyaru...</i>

13:14.850 --> 13:17.240
What's your first name, by the way?

13:17.240 --> 13:18.870
Kuroe.

13:18.870 --> 13:20.280
Kuro-taso, huh?

13:21.910 --> 13:23.070
<i>"Taso"?</i>

13:26.950 --> 13:28.750
Here we go!

13:31.150 --> 13:32.920
Th-Thank you.

13:37.090 --> 13:39.780
Let's get you some blush to go with it!

13:39.780 --> 13:41.800
P-Please!

13:41.800 --> 13:44.260
<i>What's blush again?</i>

13:44.260 --> 13:46.460
Hey, can I ask you something?

13:46.460 --> 13:49.930
What made you want to look prettier?

13:51.030 --> 13:54.060
Just for ref while we're 
picking stuff out.

13:54.060 --> 13:57.400
R-Right... yeah. Um...

13:58.270 --> 14:02.560
Ever since I was a kid, I've been... sick.

14:02.560 --> 14:05.800
It's a visible condition, 
and it gave me kind of a complex.

14:05.800 --> 14:08.540
It's made it hard for me 
to hang out with people.

14:08.540 --> 14:11.790
And because I couldn't 
be honest, Minami-kun—

14:11.790 --> 14:14.460
um, the guy I like...

14:14.460 --> 14:17.070
I gave him all these misunderstandings.

14:17.070 --> 14:21.840
I thought if I had more confidence, maybe 
I could be more open with my feelings.

14:22.370 --> 14:26.220
But today, he complimented 
the lipstick you gave me.

14:26.220 --> 14:29.990
I suddenly felt lighter than air, 
like I could do anything.

14:31.620 --> 14:36.760
I think more shining moments like that 
would give me the confidence I need!

14:37.150 --> 14:42.490
S-So... even if I can't be as pretty as 
you, I thought I should at least try...

14:46.490 --> 14:48.640
Wh-What did I do?

14:48.640 --> 14:52.660
I'm sorry. You reminded me 
of how I used to be.

14:53.320 --> 14:56.280
You'll be okay! I know you can change!

14:57.710 --> 14:59.670
Thank you for coming!

15:02.380 --> 15:05.980
So noisy! Guess they're 
doing construction.

15:05.980 --> 15:08.720
That kaiju's been making a lot of 
trouble around school too, huh?

15:08.720 --> 15:10.700
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

15:10.700 --> 15:11.930
Hey, wanna hit up a photo booth?

15:11.930 --> 15:15.690
Um, I really don't need 
to buy you a new one?

15:15.690 --> 15:18.650
The lipstick you put on me...

15:18.650 --> 15:20.610
Hey, that's no prob!

15:21.090 --> 15:22.750
I've got more than I can hold!

15:26.820 --> 15:29.490
The water line burst!

15:31.140 --> 15:32.240
Rairi-san?

15:32.630 --> 15:33.950
Are you okay?

15:45.090 --> 15:47.560
R-Rairi-san...

16:03.210 --> 16:04.480
Rairi-san?!

16:04.800 --> 16:06.290
She's looking for something!

16:09.000 --> 16:10.320
I-Is it this?!

16:15.950 --> 16:17.870
That was scary!

16:18.760 --> 16:20.860
Is your outfit okay, Kuro-taso?

16:20.860 --> 16:22.420
Um, yeah.

16:22.420 --> 16:25.420
Sheesh, that scared me!

16:26.380 --> 16:28.140
Rairi-san, what just...

16:28.140 --> 16:29.090
Let's go!

16:39.390 --> 16:41.730
<i>Rairi-san's been in the bathroom a while.</i>

16:46.270 --> 16:49.250
R-Rairi-san... that's you, right?

16:55.430 --> 16:56.940
Freaky, huh?

16:56.940 --> 16:58.200
<i>She talked!</i>

16:58.200 --> 17:00.080
Um... well...

17:00.520 --> 17:03.030
I figured you were someone 
I could open up to.

17:04.550 --> 17:07.340
Will you listen to my story?

17:09.680 --> 17:14.320
People teased me for a long 
time, calling me Gori-Rairi.

17:15.350 --> 17:19.220
It was hard, but since 
I was such a positive person,

17:19.220 --> 17:21.980
I played into it and laughed it off.

17:22.380 --> 17:28.530
Then in my third year of middle school, 
a guy I fell hard for loved my jokes.

17:28.530 --> 17:31.490
The next thing I knew, 
we were like a comedy duo.

17:32.030 --> 17:34.820
For the first time, 
I was glad to be such a gorilla.

17:35.510 --> 17:40.080
I was so happy to be with him, I started 
playing up my gorilla stuff hard.

17:40.080 --> 17:42.920
Ook, ook, ook!

17:43.610 --> 17:46.610
I don't have this much fun 
with anyone else, Rairi.

17:47.410 --> 17:51.800
H-Hey, don't say that. I'm gonna 
seriously fall for you, Okada.

17:51.800 --> 17:54.260
Sure. Fall as hard as you like.

17:55.970 --> 17:57.980
He had a girlfriend, though.

17:59.190 --> 18:03.230
Gori-Rairi, huh? 
I think she likes you, Yu-kun.

18:03.230 --> 18:05.930
Nah, I'm not into gorillas.

18:11.310 --> 18:13.680
Rairi seems pretty down lately.

18:13.680 --> 18:17.490
You're no fun, Rairi. Give us the usual!

18:18.750 --> 18:21.040
Here. Your favorite food.

18:25.360 --> 18:28.880
If you wanna play with 
a gorilla that badly, let's do it!

18:28.880 --> 18:30.540
I <i>hate</i> you!

18:30.540 --> 18:32.840
All the unsympathetic idiots!

18:32.840 --> 18:35.550
All the men who lead people on 
despite having girlfriends!

18:35.550 --> 18:37.760
The world that doesn't care 
about ugly people!

18:37.760 --> 18:38.970
This face of mine!

18:38.970 --> 18:40.430
My whole self!

18:40.680 --> 18:43.020
I hate it all!

18:48.220 --> 18:53.010
Thankfully, I fell into the bushes by the road 
and just needed a month in the hospital.

18:54.150 --> 19:00.160
The kids from my class came to see me and 
apologize, but my heart remained frozen.

19:00.650 --> 19:02.890
I figured they were still just laughing.

19:05.170 --> 19:09.200
But most of all, I hated myself.

19:12.250 --> 19:15.100
Anyway, that was when I found this.

19:15.940 --> 19:20.600
It came with a magazine. 
A collab with a famous actress.

19:21.670 --> 19:23.310
You can't fix a gorilla.

19:35.360 --> 19:39.570
Hey, Raimu-chan. 
You look kinda different today.

19:40.070 --> 19:42.040
Is it the makeup?

19:42.040 --> 19:43.490
You look so pretty!

19:45.250 --> 19:48.130
Pretty? Me?

19:54.680 --> 19:59.180
I'd been looking for something 
to pull me out of the darkness.

19:59.630 --> 20:03.430
Makeup gave me awful breakouts 
for the longest time,

20:03.430 --> 20:06.660
and when no one complimented 
me, it made me nervous.

20:06.660 --> 20:08.900
I was on the verge of 
giving up so many times...

20:09.260 --> 20:15.020
But each time I told myself, "It's okay! 
I'm super pretty! Posi-peace!"

20:15.020 --> 20:17.640
I looked in the mirror 
and complimented myself!

20:19.240 --> 20:23.200
But it was only recently that 
I really started liking myself.

20:23.650 --> 20:28.330
Wow. It must have taken 
so much effort to learn all of that!

20:29.660 --> 20:33.730
But even now, I only show my 
real face to people I really trust.

20:33.730 --> 20:36.580
Don't tell the people at school 
about the gorilla stuff, 'kay?

20:36.580 --> 20:37.300
Right!

20:37.300 --> 20:39.320
I've got a dream, too.

20:39.320 --> 20:42.490
I'd like to launch my own makeup brand.

20:42.490 --> 20:45.100
I want to create makeup that allows girls,

20:45.100 --> 20:48.770
with no confidence, like us, 
to make a change if they want it.

20:48.770 --> 20:51.940
That's why I work hard on my 
cosmetics reports every day!

20:51.940 --> 20:53.650
So I can get more work!

20:53.650 --> 20:56.610
I know you can do it, Rairi-san!

20:56.610 --> 20:59.800
Invent some makeup that 
can make even a kaiju cute!

20:59.800 --> 21:01.110
Kaiju?

21:01.110 --> 21:02.570
Oh, nothing.

21:02.900 --> 21:06.360
I mean, make cosmetics 
good enough to do that!

21:06.360 --> 21:08.050
Yeah, I will!

21:08.050 --> 21:11.920
I'll make gorillas and kaiju 
and everyone pretty!

21:12.970 --> 21:15.210
<i>Rairi-san was so strong.</i>

21:16.160 --> 21:19.700
<i>I guess there's a reason 
people like her are so amazing.</i>

21:20.720 --> 21:22.910
<i>I'd better work hard, too.</i>

21:23.710 --> 21:25.060
I'm home!

21:25.560 --> 21:28.120
Welcome home, Kuro-ta—

21:29.020 --> 21:31.770
What happened to your face? 
Are you wearing makeup?!

21:31.770 --> 21:35.090
Is it that surprising?! 
And not you too, Jumbo King!

21:36.750 --> 21:39.980
I don't think it suits you, Kuro-tan.

21:39.980 --> 21:42.520
I like you best 
when you look like yourself.

21:43.030 --> 21:45.920
Well, I get to decide how 
I like <i>myself</i> best!

21:46.800 --> 21:49.170
Except you're doing it 
for Minami-kun, right?

21:51.790 --> 21:53.860
Maybe it really doesn't suit me?

21:53.860 --> 21:57.120
But Rairi-san knows what she's doing...

22:01.970 --> 22:06.430
m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215

22:01.970 --> 22:06.430
Ready for the field trip
in two days? I can't wait
to get to Okutama!

22:02.710 --> 22:04.700
Ready for the field trip?

22:04.700 --> 22:06.430
I can't wait to get to Okutama!

22:06.430 --> 22:08.620
<i>The field trip, huh?</i>

22:08.620 --> 22:11.360
<i>I hope we can spend 
our free time together.</i>

22:13.030 --> 22:15.190
<i>Maybe I'll take the lipstick.</i>

22:15.590 --> 22:19.410
<i>I'm pretty sure he liked it...</i>

22:27.240 --> 22:28.580
Kuro-tan, dinner—

22:30.500 --> 22:35.300
Why are you shouting?! 
You'll wake up the neighbors!

22:35.300 --> 22:38.530
Knock first!

24:10.190 --> 24:11.720
Next week's sweet treat is...

24:11.720 --> 24:12.920
Marshmallows!

24:12.920 --> 24:15.270
Plain or toasted, they're delicious!
